    "body": "If something is done here, it should draw on I18N support and that should be consistent with at least Intl.DateTimeFormat (and its options). These will also be the options used by Unicode's forthcoming MessageFormat 2.0 and presumably be familiar to developers. If a compact notation is preferred, ICU's skeletons are a much better choice than \"picture strings\" (such as \"YYYY-MM-DD\").",
